    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About this game</strong><br>In this auto-battler game, you can recruit dozens of units with unique abilities and strategically assemble them to create battle teams Facing endless enemies, will your team be strong enough? Can you survive the increasingly difficult battles until the end? The enemies will give you the answer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Chess Battle Mode</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598070/extras/07460574ae0e7512956c023ca47b8e45.poster.avif?t=1754049245\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598070/extras/07460574ae0e7512956c023ca47b8e45.webm?t=1754049245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598070/extras/07460574ae0e7512956c023ca47b8e45.mp4?t=1754049245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 unique units</strong> to recruit, each with their own abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 30 treasures</strong> with different powers to strategically choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruited units can be <strong>retained, upgraded, and swapped</strong> to adapt your formation against different enemies.</p></li></ul>",
